                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "WinterWolf is never disappoint! This game is another masterpiece!!! Really, I thought Loren the Amazon is peak and then, I played Season of the Wolf and then Cursed Lands and this! \r\nOf course I have played the others, like TOA: An elven marriage, Amber's  magic shop or the beastmaster princess.... which is very good too but any grand game is TRULY on another level. \r\nPros: \r\n- Beautiful characters, even the NPCs are eye candy too\r\n- About master thief's appearances: The male elf is drop dead gorgeous, male human is boyish handsome, female human is lovely, dashing, foxy lady. The female elf is a plain, I guess she is supposed to be adorable, elegant and delicate, maybe? Her looks is kinda out of place, too simple ~~ I don't know\r\n   Facial emotions are variety and expressive, I think it's outshine any other WW's game\r\n   The master thief's character is well crafted, so unique, so full of charisma (I believe every main characters WW ever created are uniquely and differentiated). I think the hero/ heroine is the star of the show.\r\n     - Love interests are all beautiful, strong personality. Romance and alternative romance route are good. Those I  still find Loren is the best at romance writting. \r\n       As female master thief, I find Yasemine is the best one (one of the reason I like her most is her wholesome romantic endind and Rowinda!!!!!!!) . Abu comes second, feel like he is the special one\r\n       As male master thief, I find Ghamal romance route is best choice. About Halima, her love scene is okay but I can't stop but compare it with Chambara, and clearly, Chambara is a litter bit thrilling and sexier\r\n       It's odd that Di ab and Labwa are quite good as characters but their romance routes are not that thrilling. Even their triad romance is okay but not there yet. Compare to Enok and Sysrissal, Diab and Labwa triad romance are somewhat lack the special moment, I guess.\r\n       - Story: 10/10 (Story telling, twist and dialogue are interesting, fresh and detailed)\r\n       - Background music/ arts: 10/10 \r\n       - Battles/ Battle music: 10/10\r\n       - Bosses: 10/10 (there are so many bosses, I love it!!)\r\n        - City management: 10/10 (Cool stuff!!)\r\n        - A LOT OF ROMANCE ENDINGS: 11/10\r\nCons: Companion's quest fell a litter flat and short, compare to Loren. \r\n          Please make sequel, the ending with 2 demon scheming outside Dingirra is cliff hanger, yeah??? \r\nIn conclusion, thieves of Dingirra is shining bright among all VNs, on of the best VN games, I have ever played. I have a blast enjoying every bit of it and get all achievements !!!! I'll play Queen of Thief next <3 \r\n",
